{"id":"wb-5-353","name":"明福寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"明福寺塔","text":"明福寺塔位于中国河南省安阳市滑县城关镇，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n明福寺已毁，仅存寺塔，据建筑风格推测应建于宋代早期。塔为七级楼阁式砖塔，平面呈八边形，高43米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94842637,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94842637","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/074210a7914e9c98f103e986.jpg","title":"20261006_Mingfu_Temple_Pagoda_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20261006_Mingfu_Temple_Pagoda_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/20261006_Mingfu_Temple_Pagoda_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南滑县 明福寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}